    {
      "moduleId": "ModuleDescText",
      "properties": {
        "fontSize": "15px",
        "descriptionText": "<p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong>Applications&nbsp;for&nbsp;MEGAZOO&nbsp;Business&nbsp;Matching&nbsp;are&nbsp;entering&nbsp;the&nbsp;final&nbsp;stage.</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; min-height: 1.5em; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Only&nbsp;3&nbsp;days&nbsp;remain&nbsp;to&nbsp;request&nbsp;meetings&nbsp;with&nbsp;Korea’s&nbsp;leading&nbsp;pet&nbsp;companies&nbsp;and&nbsp;industry&nbsp;professionals,&nbsp;carefully&nbsp;selected&nbsp;by&nbsp;MEGAZOO.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; min-height: 1.5em; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Business&nbsp;matching&nbsp;is&nbsp;actively&nbsp;taking&nbsp;place,&nbsp;with&nbsp;numerous&nbsp;successful&nbsp;connections&nbsp;being&nbsp;made&nbsp;between&nbsp;exhibitors&nbsp;and&nbsp;buyers&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;new&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;global&nbsp;pet&nbsp;market.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; min-height: 1.5em; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Biz-Matching&nbsp;Deadline&nbsp;is&nbsp;May&nbsp;15.&nbsp;Don’t&nbsp;miss&nbsp;your&nbsp;chance&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;it.</p>",
