      "moduleId": "ModuleDescText",
      "properties": {
        "fontSize": "14px",
        "descriptionText": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">🌍&nbsp;Buyers&nbsp;and&nbsp;sellers&nbsp;who&nbsp;wish&nbsp;to&nbsp;join&nbsp;the&nbsp;<strong>exclusive&nbsp;1:1&nbsp;Biz-Matching&nbsp;Program</strong>&nbsp;with&nbsp;both&nbsp;domestic&nbsp;and&nbsp;international&nbsp;exhibitors&nbsp;must&nbsp;complete&nbsp;their&nbsp;registration&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>MAY&nbsp;15&nbsp;(Fri)</strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">As&nbsp;business&nbsp;matching&nbsp;is&nbsp;currently&nbsp;taking&nbsp;place&nbsp;actively,&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;important&nbsp;to&nbsp;review&nbsp;and&nbsp;respond&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;meeting&nbsp;requests&nbsp;promptly.</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">Carefully&nbsp;review&nbsp;the&nbsp;companies&nbsp;that&nbsp;have&nbsp;requested&nbsp;meetings&nbsp;with&nbsp;you,&nbsp;and&nbsp;secure&nbsp;valuable&nbsp;upcoming&nbsp;business&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;through&nbsp;MEGAZOO&nbsp;Biz-Matching.</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">Please&nbsp;note:&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: #0047b2;\">a&nbsp;meeting&nbsp;is&nbsp;only&nbsp;confirmed&nbsp;once&nbsp;the&nbsp;other&nbsp;party&nbsp;accepts&nbsp;your&nbsp;request.</strong></p>",
