    {
      "moduleId": "ModuleDescText",
      "properties": {
        "fontSize": "14px",
        "descriptionText": "<p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;official&nbsp;exhibitor&nbsp;brand&nbsp;list&nbsp;for&nbsp;MEGAZOO&nbsp;has&nbsp;now&nbsp;been&nbsp;released.</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; min-height: 1.5em; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Explore&nbsp;Korea’s&nbsp;leading&nbsp;pet&nbsp;brands&nbsp;carefully&nbsp;selected&nbsp;by&nbsp;MEGAZOO,&nbsp;alongside&nbsp;global&nbsp;exhibitors&nbsp;strongly&nbsp;committed&nbsp;to&nbsp;entering&nbsp;and&nbsp;expanding&nbsp;within&nbsp;the&nbsp;Korean&nbsp;market.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; min-height: 1.5em; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Review&nbsp;the&nbsp;exhibitor&nbsp;list&nbsp;in&nbsp;advance&nbsp;and&nbsp;shortlist&nbsp;the&nbsp;companies&nbsp;that&nbsp;match&nbsp;your&nbsp;business&nbsp;interests&nbsp;to&nbsp;prepare&nbsp;a&nbsp;more&nbsp;efficient&nbsp;and&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;meeting&nbsp;schedule&nbsp;onsite.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; min-height: 1.5em; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.7; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">At&nbsp;Korea’s&nbsp;largest&nbsp;pet&nbsp;industry&nbsp;exhibition,&nbsp;discover&nbsp;the&nbsp;latest&nbsp;pet&nbsp;industry&nbsp;trends&nbsp;and&nbsp;create&nbsp;new&nbsp;business&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;by&nbsp;connecting&nbsp;with&nbsp;key&nbsp;industry&nbsp;professionals&nbsp;from&nbsp;around&nbsp;the&nbsp;world.</p><p style=\"word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.7; marg